  "name": "pdh-niue_population_grid_2020",
  "notes": "Population Raster Niue 2020\r\nData Input: Household locations from Open Street Maps - HOSM Niue Building footprint. https://data.humdata.org/dataset/hotosm_niu_buildings\r\nPopulation allocated proportionally using 2011 census population counts at enumeration area level.\r\nYear Population Growth Rate of 0.76% has been applied to update population up to 2020\r\nThe human settlement footprint with census population allocated has been converted into a 100 m resolution raster.\r\n\n\n_Access this dataset from the [Pacific Data Hub](https://pacificdata.org/data/dataset/niu_population_grid_2020)_",
